5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin this trial with open hearts and clear minds. May we find the truth together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,I agree. We should focus on logical deductions and observe each other's behavior carefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I will be watching. It is best to let the facts speak for themselves.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic is the only way to solve this. I hope everyone remains objective.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,This is like a big mystery game! I'm so excited! Who do you think the wolf is?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience, little Sakura. The truth reveals itself to those who wait and listen.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, it is too early to guess. We have no information yet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,Indeed. Jumping to conclusions is a mistake.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Minako. We need a baseline of behavior before making accusations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you're all so serious! I'll just keep my eyes peeled!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,A calm spirit leads to a wise decision. Let us maintain this harmony.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,I will be analyzing the patterns of speech. That is often where the truth hides.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,I prefer to observe from the sidelines for now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I will do the same. I'll be noting any contradictions in what is said.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to try and find a clue! Maybe someone is acting weird!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
