31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept peacefully despite the tension.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,I have information. Servas is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Minako.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, are you claiming to be the Seer? If so, that is a direct accusation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,What?! Servas is the wolf? But he's so nice!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"My dear Minako, I am saddened that you would see me in such a light. I am merely a humble old man.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,My divination does not lie. Servas is the werewolf. We should execute him today.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"It seems too convenient. Are we sure we can trust this ""divination"" immediately?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If Minako is the Seer, the most logical move is to follow her lead. If she is the wolf, she is bluffing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I don't want to believe it, but Minako looks really sure!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Truth is often a matter of perspective, but I assure you, I seek only the village's safety.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@George, your hesitation is suspicious. Are you trying to protect the werewolf?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,I am simply being cautious. I don't trust blind claims.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your stubbornness might be hindering us. Minako's claim is direct and clear.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,George is acting a bit grumpy! Maybe he's the bad guy?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us not let suspicion tear us apart. I believe in the goodness of all here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We cannot afford sentimentality. The wolf is among us, and I have found him.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"I still have doubts, but I cannot argue with the majority's logic.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote based on the Seer's claim. It is the most efficient path.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll go with Minako! Sorry, Servas!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
